<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta intensified its campaign by bombing a religious ceremony and killing its own prisoners of war in Chin State, and by launching an arson spree in Sagaing after a colonel was killed. Japan is lobbying to have Myanmar removed from the global financial watchdog's blacklist, while the United States is seeking Myanmar's rare earths, prompting accusations of undermining the EU diplomatic blockade. Thailand suspended unofficial border trade for seven days as artillery shells from Myanmar struck Thai homes in Tak province. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxNOUE1aHhNQ1BkVTZYeHpxQzF3NDU1VzZUN1ozMHFRem81U3Z3YW50NXZ3ZUhxbnkteUdWNlhjY29HQjVOZzR4YjFvRWlid21aby1idno4YWZwbURuQ0lxcHhiaW9uRXZHTm1sWU9zT3FON2hfelBUQjNCcWlrZVRla2RrazU5VXU1dktLUmRiSmpkMkdrczBfcFRYTzhvRm9RRGJCMEo0X2IwWnRtQnVqTWNva28xd1NxalBv?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOcVY2ZW1UekNrbXdEeE9MNF9UcWR2V2FVVkoyNWU2WXlJXzlwMldvNVA5eTN1RXVGQWRpeGpQN28tamVKRmRSQTFmTTdteUV5ckV4SmZ1Qm1wZ2RBVzVQYXA0aDA3NWJHYWd3SjZkZXVxbUwta2dlb0hwemRHYzhTM1N0T21iNTdreDJ3OENuTEhSMmNBLUZyNFRSOHk2SV9TNUgxSTZuMkxZTHJsU0h4X1BGVEhWREk?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPRVJZVmpwcFZkRWpxdl9yRGhiekJySTVrV1JqLUxpZlNpQ0swRzRNSHAzNTBmOVFkcmpzZ212SnVyckZHYmRoMEdaTXAxVEJtYlZiZ0I0OHNqWXZSU00wdS1uY1p2LTMtd1Z6UlExXzFNQU1jOENrN1p0VnhLSElWLWNFTGtscVZmdk0xMThnNFVKMER5bHc5aHNEUHJaTUlDcU9LTmZkSkwtZ21UQnA0azZkV1JOYzBzZ3F0ZQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE51bkJ4NHZJZ3ZOYjFQeWJVS3hsOFlHU1BiNWJqMFQycmVUbEpzZWtJZklfYm9ram41b21fNHZOVGhwSGZCN19HZTNkbTdTUEpJQThMdzV6MA?oc=5&quot;&gt;